Z||000008||Hank is Here||05-22-2001||09:46 AM||||rockcrawl, <BR>  I spoke with the fellow as well on Friday along with skitime.  He did make a comment that he made those using the stock 1/4's, though at that point he was really talking about the 3800 SC logo part.  So I would assume that he did the frameless part himself too.  Actually I thought he was from MD not Va-but I could be wrong on that fact. ||||reg||1
